# ── Secure test content ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Live TEAC item content is secure test material and must never be committed
# here. This repository is public; the rules repository (paullenguax/teac) is
# private, and even there item content is excluded. Item text belongs in
# Firestore behind access rules, never in the codebase.
# See docs/teac-content-review-spec.md.
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.docx
*.wav
*.mp3
*_data.py
*_overrides.py
live/
scratch/

# Personal data (course attendee records) — this repository is public
docs/*.csv
